" parent="1" vertex="1" value="CONTRATOS DOS AGENTES · INPUT, CONTEXTO, FERRAMENTAS, TAREFA E OUTPUT" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#283446;fontSize=34;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=16;text;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="0" y="2160" width="7300" height="90" /></mxCell><mxCell id="clegend" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Exemplos compactos de JSON; envelope comum: versão, papel, domínio quando aplicável, rodada, call_id e dependências.&lt;br&gt;O Especialista recebe a fonte escolhida integralmente, sem resumir tipos. Raciocínio destinado = tarefa observável, não pensamento privado." style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#283446;fontSize=23;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=16;text;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="0" y="2250" width="7300" height="100" /></mxCell><mxCell id="card0" parent="1" vertex="1" value="ANALISTA DA PERGUNTA" style="rounded=1;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3EEFA;strokeColor=#8065A8;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#283446;fontSize=25;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=16;rounded=1;verticalAlign=top;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="0" y="2410" width="7300" height="990" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c0_0" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;b&gt;ENTRADA · JSON&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot;text-align:left;font-size:19px&quot;&gt;{&#10;  &amp;quot;question&amp;quot;: &amp;quot;Paradas da máquina 2000002 em 2021?&amp;quot;,&#10;  &amp;quot;domain_index&amp;quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &amp;quot;domain&amp;quot;: &amp;quot;dw&amp;quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &amp;quot;domain&amp;quot;: &amp;quot;industrial&amp;quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &amp;quot;domain&amp;quot;: &amp;quot;financeiro&amp;quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}&lt;/pre&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECF4FE;strokeColor=#5B80AD;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#283446;fontSize=21;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacin